Historical provenance retained after the float64 migration:
The derived float32 exponential implementation, MathProfile selection, and
Intel SVML assembly described below have been removed. The current core forbids
unsafe code and uses float64 scalar science. The following notices and license
files are retained as an audit trail; they do not describe current dispatch.
The portable float32 exponential formula in src/surface/masked.rs derives from
NumPy 2.1.3's AVX2/FMA and AVX512 exponential implementation and coefficient data:

https://github.com/numpy/numpy/blob/v2.1.3/numpy/_core/src/umath/loops_exponent_log.dispatch.c.src
https://github.com/numpy/numpy/blob/v2.1.3/numpy/_core/src/umath/npy_simd_data.h

